  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eco Dialogue Collective &#xbf; Empowering Media and Civil Society for a Transparent Green Future</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The aim of the action is to improve democratic governance and accountability in the green economy and extractive industries through strengthened civil society and media engagement and oversight (impact).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thus far only a small circle of experts exists who can make credible contributions to debates on these issues. Organising meaningful dialogue and participation for affected communities is also a challenge. For these reasons the SO is to empower media and civil society for evidence-based policy dialogue, accountability, and access to information on green growth and extractive industries through targeted capacity building, collaborative content production, and research along with dialogue events to foster stakeholder engagement and improve public policy (outcome).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The action will bolster community engagement in green growth and the energy transition by developing local CBOs&apos; capacities and improving their visibility. A key focus is on empowering women and youth within CSOs to advocate for sustainable and equitable practices in the energy and extractive sectors&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
